          "docs": "<p>Stops a dominant language detection job in progress.</p> <p>If the job state is <code>IN_PROGRESS</code> the job is marked for termination and put into the <code>STOP_REQUESTED</code> state. If the job completes before it can be stopped, it is put into the <code>COMPLETED</code> state; otherwise the job is stopped and put into the <code>STOPPED</code> state.</p> <p>If the job is in the <code>COMPLETED</code> or <code>FAILED</code> state when you call the <code>StopDominantLanguageDetectionJob"
